- **Director Relationship**: A foreign key relationship between films and directors in the crew table enhances data integrity for linking directors to films.

This enhanced schema supports comprehensive metadata management, detailed financial analysis, and robust access control, aligning with the needs of the various stakeholders in the film industry.
